==Battleground==
*4 [[Kroxo]]s (100%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Kroxo]]s (100%) spawn after 4.33 seconds<sup>130f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Kroxo]]s (100%) spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kroxo]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kroxo]]s (100%) spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Ursamajor]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]]s spawn, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having 2 crystals is required, but getting 3 makes this a lot easier. Any more and the stage is a cakewalk, as the enemies barely can do anything. [[Octopus Cat]] trivializes the stage, as it makes it so much easier to get a Bahamut to clip most of the hp of the Elizabeth, and general tankers can easily stave off the Ursamajors to prevent them from pushing when the Elizabeth is behind them.

